          "priya@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "sentAt": "2026-11-05T09:12:00-05:00",
        "body": "Azure AD sends assertions with NotBefore a few seconds ahead of our clock. We allow zero skew, so ~8% of Azure AD logins fail. Okta tenants are fine. Fix is 90-second skew tolerance, PR #223."
      },
      {
        "from": "jordan@corvidlabs.io",
        "fromName": "Jordan Okafor",
        "to": [
          "ingrid@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "cc": [
          "priya@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "sentAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00-05:00",
        "body": "90s is standard for SAML. Reviewing today. If #223 lands before Nov 10, I think verification is fine. If not, verification fails and GA moves."
      },
      {
        "from": "priya@corvidlabs.io",
        "fromName": "Priya Shah",
        "to": [
          "ingrid@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "cc": [
          "jordan@corvidlabs.io",
          "kwame@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "sentAt": "2026-11-05T09:41:00-05:00",
        "body": "Please make #223 the top priority. If verification doesn't pass by Nov 14, I'm considering moving GA to Q1."
      },
      {
        "from": "ingrid@corvidlabs.io",
        "fromName": "Ingrid Larsen",
        "to": [
          "priya@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "cc": [
          "jordan@corvidlabs.io",
          "kwame@corvidlabs.io"
        ],
        "sentAt": "2026-11-05T09:50:00-05:00",
